It's Tuesday, October 4th, 2022, another day of tutoring Eliza.
It's been 25 minutes into the tutoring session, and I would expect Eliza to finish half of her homework, but no.
Eliza has practically made zero progress.
She's only finished 2 out of 8 homework problems about linear inequalities, and this isn't even her whole assignment.
With impatience, I tap on question 2 in Eliza’s worksheet with my pen.
